WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Light takes form.
Start with shared parts.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.500
Separate. Then whole.
Bring the pieces together.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.500
A little character.
Let the material speak.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Built once. Made yours.
Bundled effects. An original composition.
